# Sidequest: Card Collection {3}{U}: "When this enchantment enters, draw three cards, then discard two cards" (the two chosen from the six in hand, the three drawn
# included). "At the beginning of your end step, if eight or more cards are in your graveyard, transform this enchantment." Turn 1: after the draw-three-discard-two,
# a Faithless Looting, a Black Lotus and a Lightning Bolt, Bot1's graveyard holds seven (2 + 3 + 1 + 1): one short, so nothing happens. Turn 2 Bot2 puts its own Bolt into
# its graveyard. Turn 3, Bot1's graveyard is still seven (Bot2's one does not count): not transformed. Turn 5 a second Bolt makes eight, and it transforms into Magicked
# Card, a 4/4 flying Vehicle. Turn 7 Bot1's Memnite (power 1) crews it and it attacks for 4 in the air.

